{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>MIRROR成員陳卓賢今日（7月23日）於啟德體藝館舉行九場《IAN CHAN :GROWTH: LIVE 2026》演唱會，首場全場爆滿，Ian先以三首慢歌打頭陣，唱完便一台小休一會。未幾Ian唱完《花邊細胞》後下台換衫，他用最後大熱的方式現身，就是在台下亦跟拍，坐着板車被推回主舞台換衫補妝。</p><figure><img alt=\"Ian除衫。（胡凱欣 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260723/1157082834502946816645217.png/8COvMjoBfRGzSloPIdgaZjjIqI2zC9KSS-dsV2LnbFc\"/><figcaption>Ian除衫。（胡凱欣 攝）</figcaption></figure><p>陳卓賢「騷肌」 在場無不歡呼</p><p>當大家以為他只是補妝，但他突然在鏡頭前脫衣服，露出強壯的胸肌。而現場的粉絲見到後立即歡呼起來，Ian亦大方地把整個換衫過程在鏡頭前呈現，更不時望向鏡頭，十分識做。</p><figure><img alt=\"胸肌。（胡凱欣 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260723/1157083152884436992128570.png/83JcJjOv5uCVo9MUKK1JCbrqiry5SO_TGjgYlzM4GJc\"/><figcaption>胸肌。（胡凱欣 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"勁！（胡凱欣 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260723/1157083150007013376720634.png/6r3j6GluiEkZmN-GEO1TIxUnIRVVQARZiuhQGqPoUBo\"/><figcaption>勁！（胡凱欣 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好大！（胡凱欣 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260723/1157083147431579648087129.png/MN-34GcAjccUk2iFSAjmjABwktEAg-RKqC_JxYEvycU\"/><figcaption>好大！（胡凱欣 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"強壯。（胡凱欣 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260723/1157083157691371520725936.png/99-3FDuZHdPQMc05QGb374QVXDsTspbgjBTSbqUU0m4\"/><figcaption>強壯。（胡凱欣 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"換衫。（胡凱欣 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260723/1157083155283709952853267.png/FZDkQl8B-AL3e6bfdhfdGCpJTmyfE-h0f8OIb1bDiG8\"/><figcaption>換衫。（胡凱欣 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"換衫。（胡凱欣 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260723/1157083152255291392215860.png/C-Nn_EDrkEH3AuY0Yx_XlYX1W-OR7tjvb-43x0buN8c\"/><figcaption>換衫。（胡凱欣 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"靚仔。（胡凱欣 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260723/1157083149952487424308174.png/6t_JU8Niw-YegNZe5TQDsOnwoekTzySgYpKUckuSlHI\"/><figcaption>靚仔。（胡凱欣 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"靚仔。（胡凱欣 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260723/1157083147507077120063815.png/5Ti4ZGkpW68Kq8TF0Pr0AvjNX73U16BIRIbdKG2G3Sg\"/><figcaption>靚仔。（胡凱欣 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"型！（胡凱欣 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260723/1157083424973262848248096.jpeg/MRJFXy66cC2i7xuFyMWHFUTcjI9nxdUO_kjkdNdI5HQ\"/><figcaption>型！（胡凱欣 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"正！（胡凱欣 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260723/1157083422745956352386972.jpeg/reXz1V1cwn6AqtPbGqToL5aoaotoVHvTSU0BAWBNAQE\"/><figcaption>正！（胡凱欣 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"又換衫。（胡凱欣 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260723/1157083420392820736318756.jpeg/fBR54nNGcbPXbbaI2Z_kWqJMkiFxzMpjT6leoWapXqE\"/><figcaption>又換衫。（胡凱欣 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"型。（胡凱欣 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260723/1157083417930633216376149.jpeg/BVWwiPD25VctdKvVppeXFUe0fkXU6KzVimdcIKNnXCA\"/><figcaption>型。（胡凱欣 攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-23T15:18:38.584740+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":388,"images":13,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}